te` (source `chat`, the team run's id), it is rehydrated at boot (`TeamCardsService.rehydrate`), and archiving retires it with the proposal card (`ChatService.retireStandingCard`). The executor auto-approves the lead's `propose_team` and `save_project_instructions` calls in every mode (their card is the gate); its `read_teams` stays the user's to allow outside `auto`, as in an ordinary chat.
