nversation's others (`alsoRunning`), since a newer monitor does not end an older one. Ids `mN` count per run; `stop_monitor` and `list_monitors` see only the calling conversation's. Offered only where a geniro tool call is put to the user first or the turn is `auto` (`offersMonitorTools` over `AdapterConfig.hostToolCallUngatedReason`, null on every CLI: measured per CLI beside its config; a team member only when every pool member passes). Never auto-approved: no `isHost<Name>Call`. The permission card keeps the CLI's remember choices, which remember the TOOL, so it says that remembering approves every later monitor command (user decision; `namesGeniroMonitor` in the renderer).
